s innocent lady!!  If so, please let me know at tru2blueyes@yahoo.com ... thanks!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6526538509425232646/comments/default/8359388078360154428'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6526538509425232646/comments/default/8359388078360154428'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/never-trust-costumed-stranger.html?showComment=1385582149692#c8359388078360154428' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/11/never-trust-costumed-stranger.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6526538509425232646' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6526538509425232646' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-225040019"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="November 27, 2013 at 12:55 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-812049630146749628</id><published>2013-11-27T12:52:51.264-07:00</published><updated>2013-11-27T12:52:51.264-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It looks like committing rape could get you charge...</title><content type='html'>It looks like committing rape could get you charged with impersonating a police officer.  Hard to tell the cops and rapists apart anymore when they both do the same thing while under the guise of being cops.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6526538509425232646/comments/default/812049630146749628'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/65265385094252326